<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Julian's eBook Library</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-secondary: #1e293b;
            --bg-card: #334155;
            --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --accent-blue: #3b82f6;
            --accent-cyan: #22d3ee;
            --accent-green: #22c55e;
            --accent-orange: #fb923c;
            --accent-purple: #8b5cf6;
            --border: #475569;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-secondary) 0%, var(--bg-primary) 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .header-text h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--text-primary), var(--accent-cyan));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .header-text p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
        }

        /* Stats Bar */
        .stats-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .stat-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .stat-item span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover,
        .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .nav-links a.active::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 1px;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        main {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }

        /* Category Section */
        .category {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .category-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .category-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .category-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .category-header .count {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* Book Grid */
        .book-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .book-card {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .book-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .book-cover {
            height: 180px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card), var(--bg-secondary));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .book-cover::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 70% 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
        }

        .book-cover-icon {
            font-size: 64px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .book-format {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .book-info {
            padding: 1.25rem;
        }

        .book-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .book-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .book-meta span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }

        .book-tags {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .tag {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        .tag.highlight {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .book-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--border);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 2rem 0;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        footer a {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .book-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav-links {
                gap: 1rem;
            }
        }

        /* Animation */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .book-card {
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease forwards;
        }

        .book-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .book-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .book-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <div class="logo">📚</div>
                <div class="header-text">
                    <h1>Julian's eBook Library</h1>
                    <p>技術架構與設計文件的電子書收藏</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stats-bar">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <span>1</span> 本電子書
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <span>1</span> 個分類
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <span>12</span> 章節
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <span>8</span> 張架構圖
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#ai-agent" class="active">AI Agent 平台</a>
                <a href="#about">關於</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <div class="container">
            <!-- AI Agent Platform Category -->
            <section class="category" id="ai-agent">
                <div class="category-header">
                    <div class="category-icon" style="background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);">🤖</div>
                    <h2>AI Agent 平台</h2>
                    <span class="count">1 本</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="book-grid">
                    <div class="book-card">
                        <div class="book-cover">
                            <span class="book-cover-icon">🏗️</span>
                            <span class="book-format">EPUB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="book-info">
                            <h3 class="book-title">建構生產級多 Agent 平台</h3>
                            <div class="book-meta">
                                <span>👤 Julian Shen</span>
                                <span>📅 2025</span>
                                <span>📄 12 章</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="book-tags">
                                <span class="tag highlight">Google ADK</span>
                                <span class="tag">A2A Protocol</span>
                                <span class="tag">NATS</span>
                                <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
                                <span class="tag">gVisor</span>
                                <span class="tag">MCP</span>
                            </div>
                            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                                從零開始設計類似 Manus AI 的多智能體平台，深入解析 Google GEAP、ADK、A2A、Agent Runtime 等核心技術。
                            </p>
                            <div class="book-actions">
                                <a href="./ai-agent-platform/manus-agent-platform.epub" class="btn btn-primary" download>
                                    ⬇️ 下載 EPUB
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://github.com/julianshen/ebooksforme/tree/main/ai-agent-platform" class="btn btn-secondary">
                                    📁 查看檔案
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- About Section -->
            <section class="category" id="about" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
                <div class="category-header">
                    <div class="category-icon" style="background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);">ℹ️</div>
                    <h2>關於這個圖書館</h2>
                </div>
                <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem;">
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        這個圖書館收集了我撰寫的技術電子書，專注於 AI Agent 平台架構、分散式系統設計與雲原生技術。
                    </p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        每本電子書都包含完整的架構圖、程式碼範例與實戰指南，採用 Boris Cherny 風格撰寫：問題驅動開頭、漸進式複雜度、類比說明、程式碼即文件。
                    </p>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <a href="https://github.com/julianshen/ebooksforme" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
                            GitHub Repository
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>Made with ❤️ by Julian Shen | Powered by GitHub Pages</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                所有電子書採用開放授權，歡迎分享與引用
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
